					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夏"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480303,
					"content": "做得好，阿夏！你的運動能力超級棒啊，看得我目瞪口呆！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480304,
					"content": "接下去輪到班尼特測試了對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480305,
					"content": "對！我已經做好熱身運動，活動開全身的筋骨和肌肉了，包在我身上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "班尼特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150480306,
					"content": "也要注意安全。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150480307
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150480307,
					"content": "嗯！多謝關心！",
